    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coupling is an abstract style puzzle game where the only thing you can do is move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can still push objects, look somewhere, and step on switches. All objects interact with each other, and you need to understand and utilize the relationships between them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to pass the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* If you find the white screen too harsh, other color configurations are available, or you can just customize the colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 2-3 hours playtime </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 types of related objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets spread throughout the levels</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coupling is an abstract style puzzle game where the only thing you can do is move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can still push objects, look somewhere, and step on switches. All objects interact with each other, and you need to understand and utilize the relationships between them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to pass the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* If you find the white screen too harsh, other color configurations are available, or you can just customize the colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 2-3 hours playtime </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 types of related objects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets spread throughout the levels</p></li></ul>",
